---
description: After a pull request merges, remove its worktree
alwaysApply: true
---

When a pull request merges, remove its worktree. Merged means start the removal. Merged does not mean stop.

If you find the pull request already merged, the worktree is still your job. Do not report the task finished while that worktree directory exists.

Read `.ai/skills/quest-remove-worktree/SKILL.md` and follow every step. Do not invent a shorter ending.
